        },
        {
          "textRaw": "JvmCancellation",
          "name": "jvmcancellation",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "JvmCancellation.isCancellationRequested()",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "isCancellationRequested",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "textRaw": "<ins>**returns**</ins> { `boolean` } - 是否已收到取消 ",
                      "name": "<ins>**returns**</ins>",
                      "type": " `boolean` ",
                      "desc": "是否已收到取消"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "params": []
                }
              ],
              "desc": "<p>非阻塞地查询会话是否已被取消 (用户停止, 超时, 宿主关闭会话等).</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-java\">if (context.cancellation().isCancellationRequested()) {\n    return &quot;cancelled&quot;;\n}\n</code></pre>\n"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "JvmCancellation.throwIfCancellationRequested()",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "throwIfCancellationRequested",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "textRaw": "<ins>**returns**</ins> { `void` } ",
                      "name": "<ins>**returns**</ins>",
                      "type": " `void` "
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "params": []
                }
              ],
              "desc": "<p>会话已被取消时抛出 JvmCancellationException. 不要捕获它后继续运行: 取消只有有限的宽限期, 不配合的 worker 最终会被直接终止.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-java\">context.cancellation().throwIfCancellationRequested();\n</code></pre>\n<hr>\n"
            }
          ],
          "type": "misc",
          "displayName": "JvmCancellation"
        },
